# ShadcnUI & Tailwind

## Component taxonomy

| Type | Path | Rule |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **ui** | `components/ui/`, `@repo/ui/*` | Pure UI — no fetch, no feature imports |
| **shared** | `shared/components/` | Cross-feature reusable |
| **feature** | `features/*/components/` | Business UI — use services/hooks, not raw API |

- `apps/web/components/ui/*` — web-only shadcn primitives
- Cross-app primitives → `packages/ui`, import `@repo/ui/*`
- Prefer Tailwind utilities over CSS files
- Radix `asChild` composition
- Check existing shadcn components before adding new ones

AI / quality: split complex UI; a11y (aria, keyboard); JSDoc only for non-obvious **why**.
